<div class="wrap mock-prose"><p class="mock-kicker">About / The person behind the code</p><h1>Hi, I'm <span class="mock-gradient-text">Zilu.</span></h1><p>I’m a Pune-based Technical Lead at Accion Labs, with 9+ years of development and automation-testing experience. I work across React, Node.js, Angular, React Native, cloud platforms and AI workflows such as LangChain and retrieval-augmented generation.</p><p>I previously worked at e-Zest (which was acquired by Accion Labs), Larsen & Toubro Infotech and LifeCOMPILERS. My public projects include Cloudflare Workers automation, event-driven microservices and open-source integrations.</p><h2>How I approach software</h2><p>I prefer practical architecture, readable code, sensible performance trade-offs, and tools that solve real problems. I also enjoy experimenting with AI workflows and sharing what I learn.</p><h2>Outside the code</h2><p>I enjoy mentoring, writing technical notes and contributing to developer communities.</p><h2>Get in touch</h2><p><a href="mailto:zilurrane@gmail.com" class="btn primary">Email me ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/zilurrane" class="btn">GitHub ↗</a></p></div></Base>